The legal text is Tunisian legislation: Loi n° 94-36 du 24 février 1994, relative à la propriété littéraire et artistique, as amended by Loi n° 2009-33 du 23 juin 2009.

Official legislative texts are outside copyright in Tunisia. Article premier of Law 94-36, as amended by Law 2009-33:

  "La protection au titre du droit d'auteur s'étend aux expressions et ne couvre pas :
   [...] les textes officiels d'ordre législatif, administratif ou judiciaire et leurs traductions officielles."

The bytes of this text come from a consolidated copy hosted by legislation-securite.tn (https://legislation-securite.tn/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2023/11/Loi-n°-94-36-du-24-Fevrier-1994-Fr.pdf), retrieved 30 October 2026. That host and the Tunisian authorities do not endorse this repository.

Changes made by Lexifina: page headers, footers and footnote markers were removed, wrapped lines were joined, and the text was arranged as one Markdown file per article and as a git commit.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
